<title>FRANCE: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF HINGIS V PIZZICHINI.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF HINGIS V PIZZICHINI.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of Thursday's French Open women's singles second round match between top seed Martina Hingis and Italy's Gloria Pizzichini (world ranking in brackets).</p>
<p>Hingis won 3-6 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Time: one hour 32 minutes</p>
<p>HINGIS (1)   PIZZICHINI (75)</p>
